-# API Specialist Gate Final Audit: APPROVED for KANBA-87 (KB-P3-09a)
-
-- Auditor: arch-reviewer (Swarm Systems/Backend Architect & API Specialist Gate)
-- Worktree: `/tmp/kb-wt-KANBA-87`
